# Normalise to LF in the repo and on checkout. Shell scripts and systemd units
# are executed on Linux; a CRLF checkout makes bash fail on `set -euo pipefail\r`,
# which is a real bug this project has already shipped once.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh      text eol=lf
*.service text eol=lf
*.timer   text eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
